{"id":"ruhm","lemma":"Ruhm","pos":"noun","rank":2590,"glosses":["fame, glory"],"ipa":"/ʁuːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/De-Ruhm.ogg/De-Ruhm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Ruhmes"},"examples":[{"text":"Manche Leute sind auf Ruhm aus.","en":"Some people go after fame.","words":[{"g":"many a","l":"manch"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"on"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Er dürstet nach Ruhm.","en":"He is thirsty for fame.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to thirst","l":"dürsten"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann nicht den ganzen Ruhm einstreichen.","en":"I can't take all the credit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717946","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},null,null]},{"text":"Sein Ruhm steigt ihm langsam zu Kopf.","en":"He's letting his fame go to his head.","words":[{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"to ascend","l":"steigen"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"slowly"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"head"}]},{"text":"Jage dem Ruhm nicht nach!","en":"Don't chase after fame.","words":[{"g":"to hunt","l":"jagen"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"after / to"}]}]}